  "collectionNotes": [
    "部分适配：真实ESP32-C6容量、精确总线、数字显示/复位及已列输入；完整应用、浏览器与实物尚未验收。",
    "原始厂家镜像保持原字节，镜像和分区校验通过；原厂程序运行结果逐版本保留，不以CLI退出码代替成功。",
    "音频PCM、无线业务、模拟电源/充电/电池ADC、物理屏幕扫描/颜色及触摸配准仍未验收。",
    "3D保留厂家CAD或尺寸依据；UNKNOWN内部与推测厚度/排针不能用作装配尺寸。",
    "TF数字卡接口按此硬件版本接入；本次原厂快照未插卡，不将无卡错误解释为无卡槽。",
    "原厂最终快照 1589 种RGB颜色。 详见native-stop-summaries及逐版本限制。",
    "This is ST7789P 240×284, not ST77916. Exact Arduino and IDF windows start0/0.",
    "SDA7/SCL8 is reversed relative to several adjacent C6 boards. Display/touch reset share GPIO4; these facts are wired, not inferred from another model.",
    "Schematic ALDO4 LCD analogue rail, SYS_OUT18 control, PMIC PWR key and physical battery/charger are not fully emulated. DCDC1 digital rail gate does not establish analogue power acceptance.",
    "Physical body depth17.7 mm differs from overall19 mm including actuators; inferred actuator geometry is not added as a measured click target."
  ]
}
